    relations: 'The trained minds are this seat’s people: children and students who argue like you taught them, which they will use against you, which is the point. Enjoy losing to them occasionally. It is the diploma you were actually issuing all along.',
    turn_catalyst: 'Run thin, the workshop dims early: wit intact, output shelved. Start the late project now. The root feeds on making, at every age.',
    turn_friction: 'Run heavy, the correcting outpaces the connecting: family edited more than embraced. Hug first, revise later.',
