    turn_catalyst: 'Run thin, the command idles: authority earned, arenas avoided. Take the demanding seat this season. The early training wants using.',
    turn_friction: 'Run heavy, the armor stays on at home: every dinner a debriefing. Disarm at the door, nightly, on purpose.',
